From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan <ryan@esterlines.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:58:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Add per-site farbling seeds and a keyed PRNG

The UI process keeps a 128-bit token per site, mixed with session entropy
that is never written to disk, and sends the effective seed to each page
and worker. Environment settings objects copy it at creation so two tabs
in one WebContent process cannot share a seed. A small xorshift generator
in LibWeb/Farbling produces a stable stream per (seed, key).
---
